Your use of the place structure of {dunda} is inconsistent. Also, you might 
add some of the gismu derivations; e.g. {barda} is Hindi "bar" (I don't know 
the actual Hindi spelling) + Chinese "da", with overtones of "large" and 
"kabir" (or "akbar", but "kabir" is the form listed in the voc file); "bongu" 
is English "bone" + Chinese "gu". Other than that, it's great!

